P1.1 RED-PAIR — author the build_evidence per-phase oracle and the paired impl that
extends the nested build_evidence closure to derive the 8 source-derived evidence keys
and thread the leaving-phase boolean flags forward from state['evidence'].

# Scope
Emit EXACTLY TWO tasks forming a fix-forward RED-PAIR against the EXISTING module
`ngv2/conductor_seams.py` at `/home/xnihil0zer0/NobleGreedv2`:

- TASK 1 (`p11-build-evidence-oracle-perphase`, `test_authoring`) AUTHORS a NEW test
